        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6634' id='15' type-v2='text' w='96379' x='1704' y='1966'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#af78f2' fontsize='15'>MOMENTUM</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#1d233a' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='7' />
            <format attr='margin' value='3' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#121429' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6143' id='16' type-v2='text' w='96166' x='1704' y='8477'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Momentum is hard to find</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e6e6e6'>At the same score, winning the previous point doesn&apos;t make the next one more likely</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='7' />
            <format attr='margin' value='3' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16462' id='27' type-v2='text' w='96379' x='1704' y='81695'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#af78f2' fontsize='15'>MOMENTUM DOESN&apos;T SHOW UP AT THE POINT LEVEL</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Winning the previous point does not meaningfully change the probability of winning the next point once the score is held constant. Players were compared at the same score depending on whether they arrived there by winning or losing the previous point. Confidence intervals were obtained by bootstrapping over matches</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#1d233a' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='7' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            <format attr='padding' value='46' />
            <format attr='padding-top' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding-right' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding-bottom' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding-left' value='120' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#121429' />
