        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16830' id='27' type-v2='text' w='96478' x='1814' y='80835'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#af78f2' fontsize='15'>BREAKS MATTER. MOMENTUM DOESN&apos;T.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e6e6e6' fontsize='10'>The first break gives a player a major advantage in the set. But winning the previous point does not meaningfully change the probability of winning the next one</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
